💰 Wallet Deposit Test Cases

Postive Test Cases - Wallet Deposit(Add Money)
Verify that the initial deposit balance is displayed correctly.
Verify that clicking on ₹25, ₹100, or ₹150 updates the deposit amount field correctly.
Verify that clicking on ₹25, ₹100, and ₹150 consecutively without clearing the field sums the values correctly.
Verify system behavior when user clicks repeatedly on ₹25, ₹100, and ₹150 tabs.
Verify that a single click on ₹25, ₹100, or ₹150 updates the deposit amount field correctly.
Verify the maximum allowed deposit amount in the field.
Verify the minimum allowed deposit amount in the field.
Verify that clicking on the "Promo Code" field is optional (not mandatory for deposit).
Verify that entering a valid promo code applies the discount/offer as per requirements.
Verify system response when a used promo code is entered.
Verify system response when an expired promo code is entered.
Verify system response when an invalid promo code is entered.
Verify the behavior when the user clicks on the "Proceed" button to add money.
Verify that clicking on the "Stripe" option redirects to the appropriate payment gateway page.
Verify that clicking on "Card and Net Banking" redirects to the correct page.
Verify that clicking on "Coinbase" redirects to the correct crypto deposit page.
Verify that clicking on "Paytm" redirects to the correct Paytm payment gateway.
Verify that the entered deposit amount is successfully transferred through all supported methods (Paytm, UPI, Stripe, etc).

❌ Negative Test Cases – Wallet Deposit (Add Money)
Verify entering a deposit amount below the minimum limit.
Verify entering a deposit amount above the maximum limit.
Verify entering special characters in the amount field (e.g., #25, !100).
Verify entering alphabets in the amount field (e.g., fifty, abc).
Verify leaving the amount field empty and clicking the "Proceed" button.
Verify entering negative values in the amount field (e.g., -100).
Verify entering zero (0) in the amount field.
Verify clicking on the promo code field and entering only spaces.
Verify applying a promo code that has already been used.
Verify entering an expired promo code.
Verify entering a promo code in invalid format (e.g., too short, contains special characters).
Verify clicking on “Proceed” with invalid or empty promo code and expecting a discount.
Verify redirection failure when clicking on a payment gateway option (e.g., Stripe or Paytm link broken).
Verify system behavior when Internet connection is lost after clicking “Proceed.”
Verify entering excessive value by pasting a very large number (e.g., 9999999999).
